    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Share your feedback</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/2e3b970e6c71e569ddee6ae99272c706.avif?t=1740162066\" width=289 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please share your feedback directly with us on our Discord server \ud83d\udc96</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/0eea9553b7a06683d61f4fe5b6632b28.poster.avif?t=1740162066\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/0eea9553b7a06683d61f4fe5b6632b28.webm?t=1740162066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/0eea9553b7a06683d61f4fe5b6632b28.mp4?t=1740162066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take control of Joan, an ex-military who is dragged to a much more personal war when Elliot, Joan\u2019s girlfriend, is kidnapped by a mysterious enemy force. She must chase the culprits through a paradisiac island and save her girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/1e437c84e03f96c1bb82275357b8ee98.poster.avif?t=1740162066\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/1e437c84e03f96c1bb82275357b8ee98.webm?t=1740162066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/1e437c84e03f96c1bb82275357b8ee98.mp4?t=1740162066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its roots in classic games from the 90s like Virtua Cop 2 and Time Crisis, Grand Shooter innovates by bringing a big variety of guns for players to use, such as pistols, rifles, shotguns and machineguns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MORE THAN 70 MISSIONS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get along Joan in her chase for Elliot, defeating the enemies in her way and watching out for civilians. Each main mission tells a part of the whole story, unraveling its secrets and getting close to rescue her girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you brave enough to get to the bottom of this?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/0eea9553b7a06683d61f4fe5b6632b28.poster.avif?t=1740162066\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/0eea9553b7a06683d61f4fe5b6632b28.webm?t=1740162066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/0eea9553b7a06683d61f4fe5b6632b28.mp4?t=1740162066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take control of Joan, an ex-military who is dragged to a much more personal war when Elliot, Joan\u2019s girlfriend, is kidnapped by a mysterious enemy force. She must chase the culprits through a paradisiac island and save her girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/1e437c84e03f96c1bb82275357b8ee98.poster.avif?t=1740162066\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/1e437c84e03f96c1bb82275357b8ee98.webm?t=1740162066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/1e437c84e03f96c1bb82275357b8ee98.mp4?t=1740162066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its roots in classic games from the 90s like Virtua Cop 2 and Time Crisis, Grand Shooter innovates by bringing a big variety of guns for players to use, such as pistols, rifles, shotguns and machineguns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MORE THAN 70 MISSIONS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get along Joan in her chase for Elliot, defeating the enemies in her way and watching out for civilians. Each main mission tells a part of the whole story, unraveling its secrets and getting close to rescue her girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you brave enough to get to the bottom of this?</p>",
    "short_description": "Grand Shooter is the reinvention of the Light Gun On-Rails Shooter genre, from old school arcades to modern devices. Shoot everything that moves\u2014just make sure they aren't hostages! \ud83d\ude46\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udd1c\ud83d\udc94",
